  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ashok Mangla & Another vs State Of Hp Through Its Secretary ... on 13 May, 2015",
    "facts": "This writ petition has been filed with the following prayers:- \"(i). Issue a writ of mandamus directing the Respondent authorities to implement Section 36 (2) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and thereby create at least Ashok Mangla & Another vs State Of Hp Through Its Secretary ... In reply to this para, it is submitted that in pursuance to . the Act, the State Govt. has promulgated the R&P Rules qua Designated Officer. The process for filling up 5 posts of Designated Officer through direct recruitment has already been initiated. So far filling up 5 posts through promotion is concerned, it is submitted that process for filling up 5 posts through promotion has been completed and Notification to this effect has been issued on 27.03.2015. 6. That in reply to this para, it is submitted that the process for creation of more vacancies of designated officer has already been initiated. However, it has been decided by the Govt. that the process for remaining 4 vacancies will be started once the process of filling up of 10 posts of designated officer in the department of health, Safety and r regulation has completed.\" 3. Since, the respondent-State has already framed the R & P Rules and also initiated the process for filling up 10 posts of Designated Officers and has undertaken to initiate the process for filling up remaining 04 posts on the completion of the process, already initiated to fill up 10 posts, no order is required to be passed.",
